## 🚀 Common Commands

### Backend (Laravel)
```bash
php artisan serve              # Start dev server
php artisan migrate            # Run migrations
php artisan db:seed            # Seed database
php artisan optimize:clear     # Clear optimizations
php artisan tinker             # Interactive shell
```

### Frontend (Node/Vite)
```bash
npm run dev                    # Start Vite dev server
npm run build                  # Build for production
npm run preview                # Preview production build
npm run lint                   # Run ESLint
```

### Database
```bash
php artisan migrate:fresh      # Drop & re-run migrations
php artisan make:migration     # Create new migration
php artisan make:model         # Create new model
```

---

## 🔌 API Endpoints (Important)

### Prompts
- `GET /api/prompts` - List prompts (filters: custom, view, page, search, paperId, sectionId)
- `POST /api/prompts` - Create custom prompt
- `PUT /api/prompts/{id}` - Update prompt
- `DELETE /api/prompts/{id}` - Delete prompt

### Writer/Generation
- `POST /api/generate` - Generate content
- `POST /api/upload-file` - Upload reference file (GPT)

### User
- `GET /api/user` - Current user info
- `GET /api/quota` - Usage quota

---

## 💾 Database Models (Key Fields)

### User
- `id`, `name`, `email`, `password`
- `quota` (token limit)
- `ai_provider_id` (selected AI)

### Paper
- `id`, `user_id`, `name`, `type`
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

### Section
- `id`, `paper_id`, `name`
- `content` (generated text)

### Prompt
- `id`, `user_id`, `name`, `value`
- `paperId`, `sectionId` (optional)
- `custom` (boolean)

### Usage
- `id`, `user_id`, `ai_provider_id`
- `prompt_tokens`, `completion_tokens`
- `created_at`

---

## ⚙️ Important Config Files

### `config/gemini.php`
- Gemini API configuration
- Model settings: `gemini-pro`, `gemini-1.5-pro`, etc.

### `config/services.php`
- AI provider credentials
- OpenAI, Gemini settings

### `vite.config.js`
- React plugin configured
- Alias: `@/` → `resources/js/src/`

### `tailwind.config.js`
- Dark mode: `class` strategy
- Content: `resources/views/**/*.blade.php`, `resources/js/src/**/*.{js,jsx}`

---

## 📌 Best Practices

✅ **DO**:
- Always check if props exist before accessing (use default values)
- Use `useCallback` for handlers that are passed to child components
- Implement error boundaries for critical sections
- Use `memo()` to prevent unnecessary re-renders
- Validate user input before sending to API
- Use proper TypeScript/JSDoc comments

❌ **DON'T**:
- Directly mutate state
- Use `any` types without good reason
- Add inline styles, use Tailwind classes
- Make API calls in render logic
- Log sensitive data to console in production

---

