## 📞 Quick Reference

**Questions to ask before changes**:
- ✅ Does this break existing functionality?
- ✅ Is this responsive on mobile/tablet?
- ✅ Does this work in dark mode?
- ✅ Are there any edge cases (empty state, loading, error)?

**Before running terminal commands**:
- 🛑 **STOP** - Ask user permission
- 📋 Explain what will happen
- ⏸️ Wait for approval

